# Run OUTPUT is not source. Code and verdicts live in git; what a run produces does not —
# same rule as HERMES keeping experiment data out of the data root.
#
# Drafts and reviews are markdown + JSON, so a script-only loop stays small. If a run ever pulls
# assets or voiceover, this directory should move OUT of the repo entirely (the HERMES analogue
# is a separate volume) rather than growing here.
*
!.gitignore
